---
const SIGNUP_URL = 'https://go.marginapp.in';
const periods = ['Every year on record', 'Last 12 months', 'Last 3 years', 'FY 2025-26', 'Dates you choose'];
const tags = ['Money in and out', 'Net invested', 'Money-weighted return', 'Per brokerage', 'Charges by year'];
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="reveal lg:order-2">
        <p class="text-xs text-gold-400 tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Net Investment</p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-cream leading-tight mb-6">
          What your rupees earned,<br />
          <em class="font-semibold not-italic">and when you added them</em>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Upload the funds statement your broker gives you and Margin reads the cash that moved
          between you and the market. It reports money in, money out, how much you are net
          invested, and what that has averaged a year.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
          From the same record it computes a money-weighted return, valuing your holdings today
          against every deposit and withdrawal on the date it happened. XIRR answers what your
          capital earned while it sat in particular stocks; the money-weighted return answers what
          your money earned given when you put it in, and Margin shows both figures labelled rather
          than replacing one with the other.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Cash lying idle with the broker is not in the rate, because the statement carries no
          balance Margin keeps, so the figure is understated by whatever you have left uninvested.
          Totals begin at the earliest year you upload, and Margin names any year missing in between.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-8">
          {tags.map((tag) => (
            <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted border border-border rounded-full">{tag}</span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted/80 mb-8">
          Zerodha statements are read as downloaded. Other brokers go in through a generic column mapping.
        </p>
        <a
          href={SIGNUP_URL}
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-gold-400 hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors group"
        >
          See what you have contributed
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="relative rounded-xl border border-border bg-navy-800/40 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold-400/30 to-transparent"></div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <p class="text-xs text-muted tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Funds Statement</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 mb-6">
              {periods.map((period, i) => (
                <span class={`px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] rounded-full border ${i === 2 ? 'text-gold-300 border-gold-400/40 bg-gold-400/5' : 'text-muted border-border'}`}>
                  {period}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4">
              {[
                { label: 'Money in', value: '₹51.2L', sub: '38 deposits' },
                { label: 'Money out', value: '₹8.6L', sub: '5 withdrawals' },
                { label: 'Net invested', value: '₹42.6L', sub: 'Put in less taken out' },
                { label: 'Average a year', value: '₹6.1L', sub: 'Over 7 years' },
              ].map((stat) => (
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-navy-950/50 border border-border/60 p-4">
                  <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-1">{stat.label}</p>
                  <p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-cream">{stat.value}</p>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1">{stat.sub}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg bg-navy-950/60 border border-gold-400/20 p-5 mb-4">
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mb-1">Money-weighted return</p>
              <p class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-gold-400">16.8%</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-2">01 Apr 2022 to 05 Sep 2026, holdings valued at ₹68.4L today</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-muted">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 mt-1 shrink-0"></span>
              <span>Record starts FY 2019-20. Anything you invested before that year is not in these totals.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
